sequenceDiagram
    participant App as User Application
    participant Lib as libc
    participant Kernel as Linux Kernel
    participant HW as Hardware
    
    App->>Lib: write(fd, buf, count)
    Note over Lib: libc wrapper function
    Lib->>Lib: Set syscall number (SYS_write)
    Lib->>Kernel: syscall instruction, (user→kernel mode)
    Note over Kernel: Context switch, Save user registers
    Kernel->>Kernel: sys_write() handler
    Kernel->>HW: Perform I/O operation
    HW-->>Kernel: Operation complete
    Kernel->>Kernel: Set return value
    Note over Kernel: Restore user registers
    Kernel-->>Lib: Return (kernel→user mode)
    Lib-->>App: Return bytes written
    
    rect rgb(255, 240, 240)
        Note over App,Lib: User Space (Ring 3)
    end
    rect rgb(240, 255, 240)
        Note over Kernel,HW: Kernel Space (Ring 0)
    end
